(text "SDIO series positions (E2B-09-1413 Figure 5 note 3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 123.19 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3c14d0c0-1acd-5de4-860b-16630bbc9bbf"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: Murata Type 2EL (NXP IW612): Wi-Fi 6 on SDIO 3.0, Bluetooth 5.4 on UART1 with\n   flow control; nxpwifi and btnxpuart (DKMS until Linux 7.3). 802.15.4 SPI not wired (T1-077).\n2. Absent state: rails off (blk.radio-power), wake lines pulled to no wake by the SoC.\n3. CONFIG_HOST[1:0] = 11 (SDIO, UART, SPI hosts; Figure 5 note 2). RF_CNTL, GPIO, PCM, WCI-2,\n   reset indicators and reserved pins open (E2B-09-1413 §3.3); module land from Murata's DXF,\n   mask and stencil UNVERIFIED (module datasheet not obtained).\n4. SDIO series positions fitted with 0 Ω; damping values at bring-up. UART direct." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 228.6 0) (size 129.54 20.32) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8ae0c0cd-6244-5461-a4c0-c0ec01d97b92"))
